This directory contains the following Elan programs:

CLOCK      Clock control part (top level)
CLDC       Display characters packet (intermediate level)
CLLCD      Large character display packet (bottom level)
CLSCD      Small character display packet (bottom level)
CLSSCD     Seven-segment character display packet (lower bottom level)
CLSSDS     Seven-segment display simulator packet (upper bottom level)

Read the parts in the following order:
     1. CLLCD or CLSCD or (CLSSCD and CLSSDS)
     2. CLDC
     3. CLOCK
